# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 上每次 checkout 都被改写一遍
* text=auto eol=lf

*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf

# 素材与音频永远是二进制，别让换行转换碰它们
*.gif  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.zip  binary
